摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness plugin for complete Blender 3D modeling, reconstruction, rendering, validation, and export workflows","id":"gh:1334049596","install_available":true,"language":"Python","name":"blender","slug":"CheshireJCat/blender","topics":["3d-modeling","agent-skills","blender","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness plugin for complete Blender 3D modeling, reconstruction, rendering, validation, and"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"plugin for complete Blender 3D modeling, reconstruction, rendering, validation, and export workflows"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-blender"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"An installable DeepSeek Harness plugin that gives dsh a complete Blender-backed 3D production workfl"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ow. It registers one orchestrator plus 29 directly loadable domain skills, all 26 upstream analysis/"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"validation helpers, and 13 workspace-scoped Blender tools."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Example output"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Camera-free preview generated during a real `dsh-blender` installation smoke test."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Tools"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- `blender_status` checks Blender, analysis Python, skills, helpers, and the active workspace.\n- `bl"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ender_scene_info` and `blender_object_info` inspect scenes and object-level geometry, materials, UVs"},{"id":"p8s3","text":", constraints, shape keys, and animation.\n- `blender_import` converts supported portable assets into"},{"id":"p8s4","text":" versioned `.blend` sources.\n- `blender_python` runs a small reviewed `bpy`/`bmesh` chunk and saves "},{"id":"p8s5","text":"a versioned `.blend`.\n- `blender_preview`, `blender_render`, and `blender_render_frames` create bloc"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"kout, look-dev, and animation evidence for `read_image` QA.\n- `blender_export` exports GLB/glTF, FBX"},{"id":"p8s7","text":", OBJ, STL, USD, or PLY.\n- `blender_validate_scene` and `blender_validate_export` perform target-awa"},{"id":"p8s8","text":"re audits and clean-process re-import checks.\n- `blender_helper_catalog` and `blender_helper_run` ex"},{"id":"p8s9","text":"pose all 26 deterministic reference, wireframe, contour, multiview, UV, texture, look, repair, and a"},{"id":"p8s10","text":"nimation-QA helpers.\n- The bundled 30-skill stack coordinates blockout, refinement, materials, light"},{"id":"p8s11","text":"ing, cameras, animation, reconstruction, validation, and artifact handoff."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"No Blender add-on or control port is required: each operation launches a local Blender background pr"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"nder add-on or control port is required: each operation launches a local Blender background process."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness `0.2.0-rc.2`, `0.2.1-alpha.1`, or `0.2.1-alpha.2`\n- Node.js 22.12+\n- Blender 4.3+"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" available as `blender` on `PATH`, or configured with an absolute path\n- Python 3.10+ for the option"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"al reference-analysis helpers"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Compatibility verification"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The exact DSH compatibility matrix and disposable-Profile install/start/uninstall results are docume"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"nted in the v0.2.3 verification report. The report distinguishes author verification from DSH STORE "},{"id":"p13s3","text":"approval. Rollback and platforms other than macOS remain unverified."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Install from npm"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The setup command creates a private `.venv` inside the installed package and installs OpenCV, NumPy,"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" Pillow, and SciPy. Skip it only if you do not need reference, wireframe, multiview, texture, or ani"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"mation-analysis helpers."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"To install a pinned GitHub release instead:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Develop from source"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Open http://127.0.0.1:3080, create a session whose workspace is the modeling directory, and ask dsh "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"to use `create-3d-model`."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"See README.zh-CN.md for configuration, security boundaries, headless use, and validation commands."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
